{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2023-05-23 08:15:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN THE UNITED STATES FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "CHICAGO , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED AN HONOREE OF THE CIVIC 50, WHICH RECOGNIZES THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN THE NATION. AN INITIATIVE BY POINTS OF LIGHT, THE WORLD'S LARGEST NONPROFIT DEDICATED TO ACCELERATING PEOPLE-POWERED CHANGE, THE CIVIC 50 PROVIDES A NATIONAL STANDARD FOR CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP AND SHOWCASES HOW COMPANIES CAN USE THEIR TIME, SKILLS AND RESOURCES TO DRIVE SOCIAL IMPACT IN THEIR COMMUNITIES AND COMPANY."}